6. REFUND POLICY
================================================================================

6.1 NO REFUND POLICY - DIGITAL PRODUCTS

    All products sold are DIGITAL PRODUCTS and are NON-REFUNDABLE. Once a 
    purchase is completed, orders CANNOT be cancelled, returned, or refunded 
    under any circumstances.

6.2 EXCEPTIONS - LIMITED REFUND CONDITIONS

    Refunds will ONLY be provided if:
    
    a) VERIFIED TECHNICAL ISSUES
       • The theme has critical technical bugs that prevent basic functionality
       • The issue is verified and confirmed by our technical team
       • The issue cannot be resolved through support
       • The issue is reproducible and documented
    
    b) SIGNIFICANT DIFFERENCE FROM DEMO
       • The delivered product is significantly different from the official demo
       • Core features advertised are missing or non-functional
       • The difference is substantial and material, not minor variations
       • Must be reported within 7 days of purchase with evidence

6.3 REFUNDS WILL NOT BE PROVIDED FOR:

    ✗ Change of mind or buyer's remorse
    ✗ Found a cheaper alternative or competitor
    ✗ Lack of technical skills or knowledge
    ✗ Incompatibility with third-party plugins or services
    ✗ Hosting or server configuration issues
    ✗ Customization difficulties
    ✗ Minor bugs or issues that can be fixed
    ✗ Subjective design preferences
    ✗ Performance issues due to hosting/server
    ✗ User error or improper installation
    ✗ Violation of license terms
    ✗ After 7 days from purchase date

6.4 REFUND REQUEST PROCESS

    If you believe you qualify for a refund under sections 6.2a or 6.2b:
    
    1. Contact support@kantongaplikasi.com within 7 days of purchase
    2. Provide your order number and detailed description
    3. Include screenshots, error logs, or evidence
    4. Allow our team 48-72 hours to investigate
    5. Cooperate with troubleshooting attempts
    6. Accept our final decision on the matter

6.5 REFUND DECISION

    • All refund decisions are at the sole discretion of Kantong Aplikasi
    • Our technical team will verify all claims
    • Decision is final and not subject to appeal
    • Processing time: 7-14 business days if approved
    • Refunds processed to original payment method only

6.6 IMPORTANT NOTICE

    BY PURCHASING THIS PRODUCT, YOU ACKNOWLEDGE AND AGREE THAT:
    
    • You have read and understood this NO REFUND policy
    • Digital products cannot be "returned" once downloaded
    • You accept the risk inherent in digital product purchases
